        "description": "A twenty year old automobile mechanic, Kikuzawa was first noted when Nao, under Akiyama's advice, tricked him in the first Revival Round. As she later helped him out, he holds no grudges and even quotes her when he first tries to dominate the Southern Country in Round III. He initially teams up with Yokoya to make money and dominate his team, but when he is exposed he returns to the Southern Country. As he went to school with Yokoya, he knows about Yokoya's fixation on domination and warns the other players just what type of person Yokoya is.",
