        "description": "Miura is a twenty-five year old man first introduced in Round II as No. 11, he tells Nao he won 2 million from Round I. Openly hostile to the LGT, he once accused them of being a scam, and later tells Nao the LGT is probably involved in human trafficking. He was one of the final contestants who was present when Fukunaga revealed his betrayal. Because he was tricked by Fukunaga, he is forced to participate in the Revival Round. When Fukunaga turns the other Revival Round participants against Nao, Miura is the only one who is nice to her. As a result, Nao chooses to save him and forces him to lose the Revival Round (although she gives him 200 million to cover his debt to the LGT).",
